# better-sqlite3 ships a binding.gyp, and npm implicitly runs `node-gyp rebuild`
# for any package with one, even though better-sqlite3 declares no install script.
# That build needs MSVC Build Tools + Python and fails on machines without them.
#
# It is also unnecessary: better-sqlite3@13 ships prebuilt binaries for all
# supported platforms in its tarball (prebuilds/*.node), and the library loads
# those when no build/ directory is present.
#
# No package in this dependency tree requires an install script to work.
# Revisit this if you add a dependency that genuinely needs a native build.
ignore-scripts=true
